00||BCD 5 bytes frequency (10 Hz/1 Hz byte first)|Send frequency data (transceive)|p.19-8
01||mode byte + filter byte|Send mode data (transceive)|p.19-8; filter byte may be omitted (FIL1)
02||none (read) -> 2x BCD 5 bytes with separator 2D|Read band edge frequencies|p.19-8
03||BCD 5 bytes frequency|Read operating frequency|p.19-8
04||mode byte + filter byte|Read operating mode|00 LSB 01 USB 02 AM 03 CW 04 RTTY 05 FM 07 CW-R 08 RTTY-R; filter 01 FIL1 02 FIL2 03 FIL3; p.19-8
05||BCD 5 bytes frequency|Set operating frequency|p.19-8
06||mode byte + optional filter byte|Operating mode selection|00 LSB 01 USB 02 AM 03 CW 04 RTTY 05 FM 07 CW-R 08 RTTY-R; filter 01~03; p.19-8 (no sub-command rows in table)
07||none|Select VFO mode|
07|00|none|Select VFO A|
07|01|none|Select VFO B|
07|A0|none|Equalize VFO A and VFO B|A=B
07|B0|none|Exchange VFO A and VFO B|swap
08||none|Select Memory mode|
08||BCD 2 bytes 0001~0109|Select memory channel|0001=M-CH01..0099=M-CH99; 0100=P1 0101=P2 (table prints range to 0109)
09||none|Memory write|
0A||none|Memory copy to VFO|
0B||none|Memory clear|
